  "title": "Cajun-Style Blackened Snapper",
  "description": "Red snapper fillets are coated with a peppery seasoning mix, then pan-fried in butter until blackened for a deliciously spicy Cajun-inspired meal.",
  "authors": [
    "Sandra"
  ],
